<ul id="Ax4.I3" class="ltx_itemize ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel">
<li id="Ax4.I3.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1</span> 
<div id="Ax4.I3.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:505.9pt;">
<p id="Ax4.I3.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax4.I3.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">The Human-Written Datasets denotes as </span><span id="Ax4.I3.ix1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:70%;">H.M.</span><span id="Ax4.I3.ix1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">; LLM-generated phishing content refers as </span><span id="Ax4.I3.ix1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:70%;">Syn.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax4.I3.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2</span> 
<div id="Ax4.I3.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:505.9pt;">
<p id="Ax4.I3.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax4.I3.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Synthetic Datasets are categorized for </span><span id="Ax4.I3.ix2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:70%;">Disclosure</span><span id="Ax4.I3.ix2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">, where LLM-generated phishing emails are available to the public; </span><span id="Ax4.I3.ix2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:70%;">Private</span><span id="Ax4.I3.ix2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">, where LLM-generated phishing emails adapt to specific research targets and are not available to the public; </span><span id="Ax4.I3.ix2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:70%;">N.A.</span><span id="Ax4.I3.ix2.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">, where LLMs are employed for phishing text transformation rather than direct generation.</span></p>
</div></li>
</ul></div></div>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
