</div></li>
<li id="Ax4.I4.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2</span> 
<div id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Datasets for advancement of phishing detectors involving Regulation Datasets </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib75" title="" class="ltx_ref">75</a><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">]</span></cite><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">; Human-generated phishing emails </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib38" title="" class="ltx_ref">38</a><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">]</span></cite><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">; Spam email dataset </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">28</a><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">]</span></cite><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">; Email Classification Dataset </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib23" title="" class="ltx_ref">23</a><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">]</span></cite><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">; The Spam Assassin Email </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.14" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">28</a><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.15" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">]</span></cite><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.16" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">; Cambridge Cybercrime Dataset </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.17" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">47</a><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.18" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">]</span></cite><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.19" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">; Human ChatGPT Comparison Corpus (HC3) </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.20" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">17</a><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.21" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">]</span></cite><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.22" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">; TREC 2007 public corpus </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.23" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">27</a><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.24" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">]</span></cite><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.25" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">, The CEAS 2008 public corpus </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.26" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib66" title="" class="ltx_ref">66</a><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.27" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">]</span></cite><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.28" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">; Hugging Face Phishing datsets </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.29" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib61" title="" class="ltx_ref">61</a><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.30" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">]</span></cite><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.31" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">; Human Crafted Phishing Dataset </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.32" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib62" title="" class="ltx_ref">62</a><span id="Ax4.I4.ix2.p1.1.33" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">]</span></cite></p>
</div></li>
</ul></div></div>
